<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ml">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>H4 ShieldX - The Future of Flooring</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-purple: #9c27b0;
            --primary-yellow: #f1e311;
            --dark-blue: #1a2a44;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }

        @media print {
            body { margin: 0; padding: 0; border: none; }
            .no-print { display: none; }
            .page-border { border: 15px solid var(--primary-yellow) !important; height: 96vh; }
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Meera', sans-serif;
            margin: 0; padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            display: flex; justify-content: center;
        }

        .page-border {
            width: 210mm; /* A4 Width */
            min-height: 297mm; /* A4 Height */
            background: var(--white);
            border: 20px solid var(--primary-yellow);
            box-sizing: border-box;
            position: relative;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        header {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .logo-box img { height: 80px; }

        .shieldx-title {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-purple), #673ab7);
            color: white; padding: 10px 30px; border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .hero-section { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; }
        .hero-section h1 { color: var(--dark-blue); font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .hero-section p { font-size: 18px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6; }

        .highlight-box {
            background: #fff9c4; border-left: 10px solid var(--primary-purple);
            padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 15px 15px 0;
        }

        .highlight-box h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--primary-purple); font-size: 24px; }

        /* 3D Visual Gallery */
        .design-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px; margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .design-item {
            border: 2px solid #ddd; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; height: 180px; position: relative;
        }

        .design-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
        .design-label {
            position: absolute; bottom: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            color: white; width: 100%; text-align: center; padding: 5px 0; font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* Features Grid */
        .features-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 15px; margin: 40px 0;
        }

        .feature-card {
            text-align: center; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 12px; background: #fafafa;
        }

        .feature-card img { width: 40px; height: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .feature-card h4 { font-size: 14px; margin: 0; color: var(--dark-blue); }

        .main-features { line-height: 2; font-size: 18px; color: #333; }
        .main-features b { color: var(--primary-purple); }

        footer {
            position: absolute; bottom: 40px; width: calc(100% - 80px);
            border-top: 2px solid #f1e311; padding-top: 20px; text-align: center;
        }

        .contact-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-around; font-weight: bold; color: var(--dark-blue); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="page-border">
        <header>
            <div class="logo-box">
                <img src="https://i.imgur.com/xGvN0eF.png" alt="AV Chem Logo">
            </div>
            <div class="shieldx-title">H4 ShieldX</div>
        </header>

        <div class="hero-section">
            <h1 class="lang-ml">കേരളത്തിൽ ആദ്യമായി: ഫ്ലോറിംഗിലെ വിസ്മയം!</h1>
            <p>സാധാരണ ടൈലുകൾക്കും വാട്ടർപ്രൂഫിംഗിനും അപ്പുറം, നിങ്ങളുടെ വീടിന്റെ തറയെ ഒരു കലാസൃഷ്ടിയാക്കി മാറ്റുന്ന അത്യാധുനിക <b>Chemical Bonding System.</b></p>
        </div>

